  "details": "Description\n\nIf you have a custom icon setup using the in-game camera without VRC+ it will reset back to the icon used by your avatar\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nJust create a custom icon with the camera, apply it and then restart your game.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer (Linux with Proton)\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1885-81193b80fa-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.60f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
